# Copy to .env for local development (never commit a real .env).
# The Gemini key is read ONLY by the serverless function api/chat.js.
# Get a free-tier key yourself from Google AI Studio, then paste it
# into Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables as
# GEMINI_API_KEY (Production) and redeploy. Until then, the chatbot
# answers from the local portfolio FAQ fallback.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
